  "notes": "Warm paper-toned LMS (beige #f5f3ee canvas, white panels with hairline #e3ded3 borders, no shadows) with a deep teal primary. The page is personalised around a student's situation: missed-week banner, version-mismatch warnings (draft on v6 vs required v3) repeated in the card, the draft panel and the dataset link, a countdown to tonight's critique, and a catch-up checklist. Draft panel uses tiny chart thumbnails (line, small multiples, heatmap) as status icons. Mono type is used for time/IDs to signal precision. Two trails coexist: a 'Your path' history trail in a strip and a location breadcrumb above the serif title. ⌘K opens a centered palette with context-suggested results grouped by type tags (WEEKS, READINGS, DATASETS, WORK). Hover tooltips on dotted-underlined in-text links show where the resource lives."
